      "id": "a16c16539673-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option. Statement: The city council mandated that all residents wear masks when using public transport systems. Assumptions: I. Wearing masks reduces the transmission rate of airborne illnesses. II. A significant number of residents use public transport. III. The city council has the authority to enforce such regulations.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: The city council mandated that all residents wear masks when using public transport systems.</p>\n\n<p>Assumptions:<br />\nI. Wearing masks reduces the transmission rate of airborne illnesses.<br />\nII. A significant number of residents use public transport.<br />\nIII. The city council has the authority to enforce such regulations.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I and III are implicit",
          "html": "Only I and III are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "All I, II, and III are implicit",
          "html": "All I, II, and III are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Only I is implicit",
          "html": "Only I is implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only II and III are implicit",
          "html": "Only II and III are implicit"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p data-end=\"400\" data-start=\"325\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span data-end=\"398\" data-start=\"325\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">I. Wearing masks reduces the transmission rate of airborne illnesses.</span></p>\n\n<ul data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"401\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\n\t<li data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"401\">\n\t<p data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"403\">The council would mandate masks only if it believes masks are effective.<br data-end=\"482\" data-start=\"479\" />\n\t<span data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"485\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Required assumption</span></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"401\">\n\t<p data-end=\"833\" data-start=\"759\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span data-end=\"831\" data-start=\"759\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">III. The city council has the authority to enforce such regulations.</span></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"834\">\n\t<p data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"836\">A mandate presupposes that the issuing body has the legal authority.<br data-end=\"907\" data-start=\"904\" />\n\t<span data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"910\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Required assumption</span></p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
