      "question": "In a row of students, Sita is 12th from the right end. If she shifts 5 positions to her left, she becomes 18th from the left end. What is the total number of students in the row?",
      "questionHtml": "In a row of students, Sita is 12th from the right end. If she shifts 5 positions to her left, she becomes 18th from the left end. What is the total number of students in the row?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "34",
          "html": "34"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "35",
          "html": "35"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "33",
          "html": "33"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "32",
          "html": "32"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">N – 16 = 18.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">N = 18 + 16</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">  = 34.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Total number of students = 34.</span></p>\n",
